WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.812
If you travel to Europe without a visa, or on a short-stay visa, there's a limit on how long you can stay.

00:06.762 --> 00:13.287
Stay even one day too long, and you could face a fine, trouble at the border, or a ban on coming back.

00:15.187 --> 00:21.662
Here's the rule: in any one hundred and eighty days, you can spend no more than ninety days in the Schengen Area.

00:21.612 --> 00:26.612
The window moves every single day, so counting by hand is easy to get wrong.

00:28.512 --> 00:30.887
This app does the counting for you.

00:34.515 --> 00:38.865
Tap the plus button, and pick your entry and exit dates on the calendar.

00:38.815 --> 00:42.277
Give the trip a name if you like, say, Paris.

00:42.277 --> 00:45.277
Tap Save, and the trip is on your calendar.

00:47.177 --> 00:52.214
At the top, you can see how many days you've used, and how many you have left today.

00:52.164 --> 00:58.852
The number on each future day shows how many days you'll have on that date, so you can plan your next trip well in advance.

01:00.752 --> 01:04.327
If a trip goes over the limit, those days turn red.

01:04.277 --> 01:06.914
You'll know before you book a single ticket.

01:16.012 --> 01:17.874
Travelling as a family?

01:17.824 --> 01:20.887
Create a separate profile for each person.

01:20.887 --> 01:23.649
Days are counted for everyone separately.

01:25.549 --> 01:29.686
Now, the most important part: never losing your trips.

01:29.636 --> 01:33.261
Open Settings, and sign in with Google or Apple.

01:33.261 --> 01:39.724
With a Premium subscription, your trips are saved in the cloud and synced across all your devices automatically.

01:41.624 --> 01:44.161
Lost your phone, or got a new one?

01:44.111 --> 01:49.199
Install the app, sign in with the same account, and all your trips come right back.

01:56.887 --> 02:09.524
There's more: a planner for future trips, an AI assistant for travel routes, shared profiles for your family, QR transfer between phones, a PDF report for border checks, and export to your phone's calendar.

02:11.424 --> 02:13.199
Schengen Calculator.

02:13.149 --> 02:15.961
Get it on Google Play or the App Store.

02:15.961 --> 02:18.036
Links are in the description.
